   00465| /// T96 (the backstop behind G13, G17 and T29): unless the first write verb is
   00466| /// a seeded whole-file write, a literal-file plan reads its target first, and
   00467| /// an existing non-empty file is replaced only when the request says so.
   00468| #[test]
